---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "Miami Mortgage Tools | Quote, Preapproval, Calculator & Scenario Reviews";
const description = "Use Miami mortgage tools for preapproval, quote comparison, payment review, condo loan review, jumbo review, refinance analysis, investor loans, and self-employed mortgage planning.";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Conversion and planning hub</p><h1>Miami Mortgage Tools and Scenario Reviews</h1><p>Move from research to action with quote checklists, preapproval quiz paths, condo building reviews, jumbo reviews, refinance analysis, investor reviews, and payment planning tools.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mortgage-preapproval-quiz-miami.html">Start Preapproval Quiz</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Use Calculator</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span class="trust-pill">Matthew Gromadzki</span><span class="trust-pill">NMLS #2560919</span><span class="trust-pill">Miami-Dade focused</span></div></div><form class="lead-form"><h2>Start a Scenario Review</h2><p>Share the basics so the right mortgage path can be reviewed.</p><label>Mortgage goal<select><option>Select one</option><option>Purchase</option><option>Refinance</option><option>Cash-out refinance</option><option>Condo review</option><option>Investor / DSCR</option><option>Self-employed borrower</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Property city<input placeholder="Miami, Brickell, Doral..."></label><label>Property type<select><option>Select one</option><option>Single-family</option><option>Condo</option><option>Townhome</option><option>Multi-unit</option><option>Investment property</option></select></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Price or value<input placeholder="$650,000"></label><label>Down payment / equity<input placeholder="10%, 20%, $100k..."></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Credit range<select><option>Select range</option><option>760+</option><option>720-759</option><option>680-719</option><option>640-679</option><option>600-639</option></select></label><label>Income type<select><option>Select type</option><option>W-2</option><option>Self-employed</option><option>1099</option><option>Investor / rental</option><option>Foreign national</option></select></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Name<input></label><label>Phone<input></label></div><label>Email<input type="email"></label><label>Notes<textarea rows="4" placeholder="Condo building, deadline, loan questions..."></textarea></label><button class="btn btn-primary full" type="button">Send Scenario</button><p class="form-note">Preview only. Production form connects to your CRM/webhook.</p></form></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">High-intent paths</p><h2>Choose the tool that matches the borrower situation</h2><p>These pages capture searchers who need a specific mortgage answer, not a generic contact page.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="mortgage-preapproval-quiz-miami.html"><h3>Miami Mortgage Preapproval Quiz</h3><p>Answer a few scenario questions before requesting preapproval so the right loan path, documents, and property issues can be reviewed early.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="mortgage-quote-checklist-miami.html"><h3>Miami Mortgage Quote Checklist</h3><p>Compare mortgage quotes beyond the rate by reviewing monthly payment, cash to close, points, fees, insurance, taxes, and condo or property issues.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="documents-needed-for-mortgage-miami.html"><h3>Documents Needed for a Mortgage in Miami</h3><p>Prepare a cleaner mortgage file with the income, asset, credit, identity, property, and condo documents lenders commonly review.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="miami-condo-loan-review.html"><h3>Miami Condo Loan Review</h3><p>Review the borrower and the building before relying on a Miami condo mortgage quote or preapproval.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="jumbo-mortgage-review-miami.html"><h3>Jumbo Mortgage Review Miami</h3><p>Review jumbo loan structure, reserves, assets, appraisal risk, and documentation before making an offer on a higher-priced Miami property.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="self-employed-mortgage-review-miami.html"><h3>Self-Employed Mortgage Review Miami</h3><p>Review income documentation before assuming a traditional mortgage, bank statement loan, or no-tax-return option is the right path.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="investor-loan-review-miami.html"><h3>Miami Investor Loan Review</h3><p>Compare investor loan options based on rental income, property type, occupancy, entity structure, down payment, reserves, and exit strategy.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="foreign-national-mortgage-review-miami.html"><h3>Foreign National Mortgage Review Miami</h3><p>Plan financing for a Miami purchase when the borrower is not a U.S. citizen or has international income, assets, or residency considerations.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="refinance-analysis-miami.html"><h3>Miami Refinance Analysis</h3><p>Review whether a refinance makes sense after considering current loan terms, equity, cash-out goal, taxes, insurance, property type, and closing costs.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="rate-watch-miami.html"><h3>Miami Mortgage Rate Watch</h3><p>Use rate context correctly: compare quote timing, lock assumptions, points, lender credits, and payment instead of relying on generic advertised rates.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="second-home-mortgage-miami.html"><h3>Second Home Mortgage Miami</h3><p>Plan a Miami second-home purchase with realistic payment, reserves, condo rules, occupancy expectations, and insurance assumptions.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="mortgage-closing-timeline-miami.html"><h3>Miami Mortgage Closing Timeline</h3><p>Understand what can speed up or slow down a Miami mortgage closing, especially when condos, jumbo loans, insurance, or assistance programs are involved.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="mortgage-approval-problems-miami.html"><h3>Miami Mortgage Approval Problems</h3><p>Identify loan roadblocks early so you can compare alternatives before losing time on the wrong mortgage path.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="low-credit-mortgage-miami.html"><h3>Low Credit Mortgage Miami</h3><p>Understand how credit score range, credit history, down payment, debts, and compensating factors can affect Miami mortgage options.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="mortgage-payment-review-miami.html"><h3>Miami Mortgage Payment Review</h3><p>Estimate the real Miami housing payment, not just principal and interest, before choosing a price range or submitting an offer.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="mortgage-consultation-miami.html"><h3>Mortgage Consultation Miami</h3><p>Talk through the mortgage scenario before applying, making an offer, or choosing between loan programs.</p><span>Open tool →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container two-col"><article class="prose"><h2>Why these tools help</h2><p>Borrowers do not all search the same way. Some search for a mortgage calculator, some search for quote help, some are stuck on a condo approval problem, and some need documentation guidance before applying.</p><p>These tools connect to FHA, condo, jumbo, refinance, investor, self-employed, foreign national, and first-time buyer guidance, so you can go straight to what fits your situation.</p></article><div class="content-card"><h2>Primary conversion events</h2><ul class="check-grid"><li>Call clicks</li><li>Text clicks</li><li>Quote submissions</li><li>Preapproval quiz starts</li><li>Calculator submissions</li><li>Scenario review submissions</li></ul></div></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
